{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Hangman is a multiplayer hangman game made in the Blazium Engine, that utilizes Blazium's built-in multiplayer lobby system. Create Lobbies, join games, and play with multiple friends in this basic hangman game where hilarity can ensure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter Any Word Or Phrase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418850/extras/blazium.png?t=1745465571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go crazy and type in any wacky or weird word you can think of to confuse your friends. The harder the word is to guess the better your chances to win will be. Watch out though because for every letter your friends guess correctly they will receive points!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418850?t=1745465571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418850?t=1745465571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418850/e345b8a075f160acf9180f00960f298f1b717c3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745465571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418850/e345b8a075f160acf9180f00960f298f1b717c3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745465571","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Project Hangman contains acts of hanging, death, and dismemberment."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Hangman is a multiplayer hangman game made in the Blazium Engine, that utilizes Blazium's built-in multiplayer lobby system. Create Lobbies, join games, and play with multiple friends in this basic hangman game where hilarity can en